window.products.push({"id":1072084,"name":"Gardener's Supply Company Galvanized Compost Pail | Sturdy Metal Vintage Style Crock with Lid for Organic Composting Kitchen Countertop Waste Bin | Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CsfMFTxWL._AC_SL1120_.jpg","description":"With its vintage galvanized metal charm and warm mango wood accents, this compost pail will look right at home on your kitchen counter. Collect fruit and veggie scraps and easily transfer them to your backyard composter or curbside pail. Uses 4-1/2\" replacement filters (sold separately). Lid with gasket for snug fit and less odor. Heavy gauge swinging handle makes emptying easy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CsfMFTxWL._AC_SL1120_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gardener's Supply Company","source_asin":"B09G3GPMK9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1072084","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09G3GPMK9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09G3GPMK9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1072085,"name":"Household Essentials 17130-1 Rotary Outdoor Umbrella Drying Rack | Aluminum | 30-Lines with 210 ft. Clothesline,Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":103.91,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714kEthYywL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whether you’re switching to air drying for your laundry or looking for an upgrade for your current clothesline situation, this extra large parallel clothesline dryer is a smart and efficient solution. The dryer is designed with two main components: a galvanized steel post and aluminum top with durable plastic clotheslines. The top pivots, so you can easily turn it to reach every inch of clothesline when loading or unloading the dryer. This clothesline comes with a plastic ground sleeve that should (ideally) be cemented into the ground for maximum stability. When in use, the post rests securely in the ground anchor with the aluminum top in place. When not in use, the aluminum top folds down and the pole can be removed from the ground anchor, so you can remove the dryer during inclement weather (which we recommend) or if you otherwise need to remove obstacles from your yard. However, the steel and aluminum are galvanized, so they won’t rust if left out.The clothesline comes ready to assemble in just three parts, with the clotheslines pre-strung. To install with ground sleeve: 1. Dig a hole 8-12 inches in diameter and 20 inches deep. The hole should be wider at the bottom than at the top. 2. Fill the hole with about 3 inches of small rocks, then pour about 6 inches of concrete into the hole (or until concrete comes to the bottom of the ground sleeve when held flush with the ground). 3. Holding the sleeve in place, finish filling the hole with concrete (you may leave a small gap to fill in with dirt and grass if you wish). 4. Immediately run a stick or tube through the sleeve and through the concrete to the rock base to allow water to drain. 5. Insert the lower vertical pole of the dryer into the sleeve, then use a level to align the pole vertically. 6. Remove pole and allow concrete to set fully, then install your dryer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714kEthYywL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Household Essentials","source_asin":"B078RQHJFD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1072085","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078RQHJFD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078RQHJFD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1072086,"name":"Croscill Excelsior WC Comforter Set, King, Gold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sPAyqAubL._AC_SL1210_.jpg","description":"Exuding luxury and sophistication, this traditional woven damask design is offered in an opulent golden color palette. Excelsior comforter is a jacquard with twist cord trim and reverses to a coordinating woven diamond design. Shams coordinate directly with the comforter face, further embellished by flange with pleated corners and twist cord trim. The bed skirt is solid gold with box pleats and an extra long 18\" drop. Coordinating sheets are 300TC, 100-Percent cotton and feature scrolling medallion embroidery along the hems. Euro shams are reversible with a hidden zipper closure, with velvet on one side and a textured gold fabric on the other, finished with twist cord trim. The velvet square pillow is beautiful with an embroidered center bordered by scallop fringe, also accented with twist cord trim. The fashion pillow is also velvet, featuring pin tuck pleated corners, gimp and scallop fringe trim. The boudoir pillow incorporates an engineered panel of the main damask design in its center, bordered by scallop fringe. Window treatments include lined tailored panels with tiebacks and an imperial valance with tassel trim, all in the beautiful damask design. Drapery panels are sold in sets of two with tie backs included. To achieve this look, use one valance. Euro shams, decorative pillows, drapes and valances are sold separately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sPAyqAubL._AC_SL1210_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Croscill","source_asin":"B00BDAWPTA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1072086","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BDAWPTA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BDAWPTA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
