window.products.push({"id":1072211,"name":"puredown Lightweight Duvet Insert 100% Cotton Cover 550 Filling Power Down Comforter, Full/Queen, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":70.65,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nWM8-Ol2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Benefits of Using Down Comforter Sleeping is the only time you allow yourself to get some rest – free from stress, anxieties, worries, and exhaustion from your day's hard work. So why not get the most of out of it, right? The benefits you’ll enjoy once you start using a down comforter include Incomparable and longer warmth thanks to the blanket's ability to trap body heat within the filling. Comfort during the summer season thanks to its breathability, allowing sweat and moisture to pass through the filling. This prevents your body from overheating even if you are a warm sleeper High Quality Stuffing Our down and feather are selected and disinfected strictly. With its high fluffyness and softness, our product can significantly improve users' sleeping quality. Users will feel less pressure on their body during sleeping Storage Method Many people store their comforters during off seasons. The key to storing your comforter is breathability. Letting the down breathe by keeping your comforter in a cloth bag will prevent any moisture or odor build up. It should also be stored in a location where it is not compressed and has room to stay fluffy. Give your comforter a good shake when you take it out of the bag next season and it should be ready to goPackage Down Comforter is vacuum packed during delivery. Please allow 24 hrs to recover its full loft. We recommend that you have your down comforter professionally dry cleaned Tips Protect your comforter with a duvet cover, which keeps it clean and prolongs its life. It's much more preferable to frequently clean the duvet cover than to have to constantly clean the comforter Fluff or shake your comforter regularly to expand the down clusters","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nWM8-Ol2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"puredown","source_asin":"B07MRG928W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1072211","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MRG928W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MRG928W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
