window.products.push({"id":1072227,"name":"Spaetzle Classic Round Noodle Maker by Westmark","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":75.4,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YKGsLDKOL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"This heavy die cast construction spaetzle maker from Westmark is perfect for making rather long strands of spaetzle which are much more like noodles than dumplings. Measuring 16 inches long with a 3 inch diameter and a 3.5 inch deep container this spaetzle maker works like a potato ricer3A the hinged upper handle with its attached circular press forces dough through the perforations in the bottom of the container. The noodles produced are very thin and elegant. To make short noodles, rest the dough filled press above the boiling water and squeeze the handles together - for longer noodles hold it about 5 inches above the water. Cooked potatoes, vegetables, and fruits could also be pureed with this press. The Classic spaetzle maker makes round noodles while the Special spaetzle maker makes s shaped flat noodles. Made in Germany.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YKGsLDKOL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Westmark","source_asin":"B000BV7B2S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1072227","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000BV7B2S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000BV7B2S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1072228,"name":"bbee.tech Heated Towel Rack, Towel Warmer with Timer, Wall Mounted hot Towel Warmer for Bathroom, Hardwired or Plug-in Models","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Xk-YAuMqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【 2-year warranty】 Any questions, you can feel free to contact us. Defective purchase, you do not need to return it, we will send you a new one directly. 【2&4 hours Timer】▶Timer, for the punctual among us – set it to warm your towels at your usual shower time or to turn on automatically when you come back from your vacation. You can set the working time to 2 hours or 4 hours, it will automatically shut off. ▶The towel warmer only takes 5 minutes for reaching the best operating temperature of 130°F (based on room temperature 68°F). The heating power is the same as a standard light bulb, it can reduce your electricity by up to 60%. 【Space & Electricity Saving】▶The towel warmer has 8 heating rails that all the towels can be fit over that one heated rack. As a space saver and a storage solution, it looks neat and tidy. ▶When using the heated towel rack, you do not have to wash your towel off to every single use that you can actually wait 4 or 6 days before washing your towel again. 【Resistant to rust & Waterproof】 ▶The hot towel warmer is made of 304-grade stainless steel, which is of incredibly high quality, resistant to rust, giving it a longer lifespan than the more ferrous mild steel. ▶After 6 months of waterproof performance test and anti-leakage test, it reaches IP56 waterproof standard, which is much safer. 【Easy to install】Our heated towel warmer is not only to be hardwired but also has the option of being plugged into a standard outlet. You can easily install the towel warmer by referring to the installation manual.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Xk-YAuMqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"bbee.tech","source_asin":"B08563NFGF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1072228","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08563NFGF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08563NFGF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
