window.products.push({"id":1072313,"name":"Dream Catcher Blue Tree of Life, Handmade Indians Traditional Circular Dream Catcher with Feathers 2 Keychain for Girls Kids Nursery Bedroom Wall Deco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710Yyf+-JVS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dream Catcher History & Legend Dream catchers are one of the most fascinating traditions of Native Americans, it comes from the 18th century. They believed that the night air is filled with dreams both good and bad. The traditional dream catcher was intended to protect the sleeping individual from negative dreams, while letting positive dreams through. The good dreams know how to pass through it, slipping through the holes and slide down the soft feathers tassels to the sleeping person. The negative dreams would get caught up in the web, and expire when the first rays of the sun struck them. Nice Dream Dream Catchers for Wall Hanging Home Decor Perfect hanging ornaments for your home decorative, especially like bedroom, living room, house, windows, office, balcony, wall art, etc. Multifunctional Decoration Kids Room Decor,Baby Shower Gift,Day Time Scene Show,Night Time Scene Show SPECIFICATION: LED lights dreamcatcher size: total length: material: stone, metal, feather, LED lights","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710Yyf+-JVS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tiantoksell","source_asin":"B0999GNCK4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1072313","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0999GNCK4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0999GNCK4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
