window.products.push({"id":1072507,"name":"Gordon Glass Co. One Way Mirror Window Film - 30\" x 6.5 ft","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51twlzby2vL._AC_.jpg","description":"Gordon Glass Co. One way Mirror Film functions as a mirror when viewed from the exterior during daylight hours. Gordon Glass Co. One way Mirror Film has a silver reflective coating on one side and 5% black coating on the other, creating a one way view while appearing to be a mirror from the outside. Providing privacy in a variety of settings, the one way mirror film is easy to install. Instead of paying more for expensive and fragile one-way glass, our one way mirror film offers the same viewing at a fraction of the cost. Traditional mirror films can't offer the same level of privacy and viewing that one way mirror films do. Watch over customers and employees, keep an eye on children in your daycare, or watch interviews in total privacy - our one way mirror film has unlimited potential.  Commonly Used For : Police interview rooms  Institutional observation wards  Daycare and warehouse offices  Restaurant kitchen doors   UV Rejection: 99%  Visible Light Transmittance: 6.8%  Solar Energy Transmittance: 7.9%  Solar Energy Absorption: 43.2%  Solar Energy Reflectance: 48.9%  Shading Coefficient: 0.23 IR Rejected: 92.6%  Width: 30 in   Shipped in one continuous roll Installation Instructions  ADDITIONAL INFORMATION:  This one way mirror window film, like one way glass, requires specific lighting conditions to create a one way effect. Light on the viewing side must be dimmer than that on the viewed side of the film. With Gordon Glass One Way Mirror Films, you will create a one way mirror glass effect, unlike with other silver window films.   Orders placed for multiple quantities of the same film will ship as one continuous roll up to 100 ft., unless otherwise requested by the buyer","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51twlzby2vL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TechnologyLK","source_asin":"B00I139XBA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1072507","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00I139XBA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00I139XBA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
