window.products.push({"id":1072603,"name":"Steamers for Clothes, Updated Dual Voltage Travel Steamer with High/Low Mist Mode, Fast-Heat Clothes Steamer Handheld Garment Steamer with Travel Pouc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JNLDC0ewL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"New design! Dual voltage features allows you to carry this steamer to almost any country where the voltage is between 110V-240V. High or low mist mode is powerful to remove the wrinkles. Removable brush makes your ironing more easy. The heat-resistant glove will protect you from being burned. Notes:1. Only fill the tank with cold water, do not use hot water. Distilled water is recommended.2. Never turn the unit upside down. Your fabric steamer should never be tilted past a 45-degree angle especially when the unit is running.3. For perfect use - please use hanger to hang up your clothes while steaming.4. Be careful, do not use this brush on silk or any other material which is easy to be scratched.Features: Dual voltage can be used in many country where the voltage is between 110V-240V.High or low mist mode.Removable brush.Ready to use in 2 minutes.Operations:1. Unscrew the nozzle head, fill the tank with water and lock the head back on. (Do not add water over the max line)2. Turn on the steamer. Ⅰmeans low mist mode;Ⅱmeans high mist mode. Steamer will emit steam in 2 minutes when you choose high mist mode.3. When the unit runs out of water, please turn off the steamer in time, or it will shorten the steamer’s service life. If you need to use the steamer continuously, please allow the steamer to cool and use it again at least after 3 minutes .4. When you are finished, please place the button in the “O” position and remove the plug from the outlet.Package:1* 150ml Steamer1* Carry Bag1* Heat Resistant Glove1* Removable Brush1* User Manual1* Warning Card","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JNLDC0ewL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nestsun","source_asin":"B077B24VKM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1072603","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077B24VKM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077B24VKM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
