window.products.push({"id":1072679,"name":"Season’s Need 27” Long Fake Hanging Plant Set of 2, Artificial Boxwood Plants for Home Decor Indoor Plant, Fake Vines Faux Hanging Greenery for Bedroo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-7SoxOk4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COST EFFECTIVE – Pack of 2 Faux Hanging Plants approximately measures 27 inches long to 5 inches wide; Artificial plants retain their appearance and don't require ongoing maintenance costs, making them a budget-friendly option. LOW MAINTENANCE - Artificial hanging plants require minimal upkeep compared to live plants. You won't have to worry about watering, pruning, or providing specific lighting conditions. They retain their beauty without any effort on your part, making them a hassle-free option for busy individuals or those without a green thumb. LIFELIKE APPEARANCE - Advancements in artificial plant technology have led to incredibly realistic designs. High-quality fake hanging plants closely mimic the look and texture of their live counterparts. You can enjoy the beauty of lush greenery and vibrant blooms without the worry of them wilting or fading over time. VERSATILE – Using Season’s Need fake plants you'll find endless options to suit your taste and complement your decor. They can be easily customized to match any interior design style, from modern and minimalist to bohemian and eclectic. ALLERGY FRIENDLY - If you or your loved ones suffer from allergies, artificial hanging plants are an ideal solution. They don't release pollen or have any airborne allergens, making them a safe choice for individuals with sensitivities. You can enjoy the beauty of plants without worrying about triggering any allergic reactions. LONG LASTING - Artificial greeneries fake leaves are designed to be durable and long-lasting. With proper care, they can maintain their beauty for years. You won't have to worry about plants dying or losing their vibrancy due to changes in temperature, lighting, or seasonal variations. This makes them a cost-effective investment in the long run. SAFE FOR PETS AND CHILDREN - Some live plants can be toxic to pets or children if ingested. Artificial hanging plants eliminate this risk entirely, providing peace of mind for pet owners or families with little ones. You can have the beauty of plants without compromising on safety. EASY INSTALLATION - Hanging artificial plants is a breeze. You can easily hang them yourself without the need for professional assistance. It's a quick and convenient way to add a touch of greenery to your space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-7SoxOk4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SN Decor","source_asin":"B0C3Y2X7J9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1072679","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3Y2X7J9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3Y2X7J9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
