window.products.push({"id":1072999,"name":"Jean Patrique Bamboo Chopping Board with Silicone Ends - Large (Green) | Durable, Environmentally Friendly.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yG5pMCkqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Go green! Protect your precious kitchen work surfaces, professional knife blades and the environment, all at once by choosing sustainably-harvested, environmentally-friendly bamboo! Gorgeous, modern, organic bamboo is one of the hardest woods available, meaning these tough durable chopping boards absorb very little water, resist stains as well as knife marks, maintaining their lovely rich appearance for years. Non-skid silicone-coated ends help secure your chopping board in place for extra safe and reliable slicing and dicing, whilst a sure-grip silicon handle makes for quick easy handling. Dimensions: Large (Green) - 11\" x 16\", Medium (Red) - 8.5\" x 13\", Small (Blue) 8\" x 9\". Jean-Patrique started when a French chef living in the UK made a small order of restaurant quality kitchenware for his family and some friends. Fast forward 20 years, we now sell over 450 exceptional kitchenware products (all sustainably and responsibly manufactured) and have over 500,000 happy customers. We truly believe in the health benefits of cooking from scratch, and we love making and sharing our own recipes. We also proudly support cooking schools, charities, and the chefs of tomorrow.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yG5pMCkqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jean-Patrique","source_asin":"B07KNBBQMP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1072999","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KNBBQMP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KNBBQMP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1073000,"name":"Unique Gift Basket for Woman - 16 oz Cute Cat Mug with Essential Oil Soap and Bath Bomb and Scented Candle - Best Birthday Gift Box, Anniversary, Wedd","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Rtg+1ZQNL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"What You Get: This gift basket for women included: 1 ceramic coffee mug, 1 x essential oil soap, 1 x bath bomb, 1 x Scented candle, 1 x pink ribbon and a greeting card(You can write down your blessings to your friends). Comes in stylish Packaging. This item is ready for gift giving. No need to repackage. Cute Novelty Cat Mug with Lid: This ceramic cat mug is made of lead-free, cadmium-free, high quality ceramic, sturdy and durable. Printed with Lovely cat pattern, with ergonomic handle, easy to grip. Perfect size and portable, the 16 oz coffee mug can be comfortably held in the hand. Dishwasher safe and microwave Safe. Perfect for coffee, milk, tea, water, neither hot nor cold beverage. Healthy and Safe: Handmade essential oil soap is made with loofah, shea butter and sorbitol, all natural, paraben free, good for all skin types. Bath Bomb select high quality raw material, ingredients and add a variety of imerals, rich in human body needs. Scented candle has been made using purest ingredients, and 100% soy wax to formulate a beautifully enhanced aroma throw. All packaged inside gift box as a set of spa for the relaxing time. Unique Gift Box for Every Occasion: Great gift for Birthday, Thanksgiving, Valentine's Day, Mother’s Day, Christmas, retirement, wedding, anniversary for women mom grandma wife teacher coworker her. Quality Service: We’re devoted to provide the best products and perfect service to our customers. We have tried out the loofah soap, bath bomb and scented candle personally, it can relieve stress and enjoy a rich natural aroma, the mug never goes out of style or fade away. If you have any questions or dissatisfaction with the product, please feel free to contact us, we will reply and solve it as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Rtg+1ZQNL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOUTYTUO","source_asin":"B096MBGCSM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1073000","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096MBGCSM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096MBGCSM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
